---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/portrait.jpg';
import { LINKEDIN_URL, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
	title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
	description="Will Woods: Senior Analyst at Hookflash, writing on organisations, people and change in defence and security."
>
	<div class="about">
		<Image
			class="portrait"
			src={portrait}
			alt="Will Woods"
			widths={[400, 800]}
			sizes="(max-width: 52rem) 60vw, 10rem"
			loading="eager"
		/>
		<div>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					I'm Will Woods, a Senior Analyst at Hookflash. I support organisations through technology,
					analytics and advisory projects, helping teams improve performance, solve complex problems
					and make better-informed decisions.
				</p>
				<p>
					I've worked with government, private sector and non-profit clients on measurement,
					implementation and consulting engagements. Much of the job is translating technical
					challenges into practical outcomes, and keeping stakeholders, delivery teams and changing
					requirements pointed in the same direction.
				</p>
				<p>
					What interests me most is where technology, people and organisational change meet. I led a
					consulting project with the Defence School of Intelligence, and I've presented research on
					organisational culture at the <a href="https://lnkd.in/etVia-XS">ACCU Conference</a>. That's
					the thread running through my writing here: what makes transformation stick, especially in
					defence and security, amid geopolitics and procurement.
				</p>
				<p>
					I studied Software Engineering at the University of Portsmouth and graduated with a First,
					which gave me a grounding in systems thinking and delivering projects across technical and
					organisational settings.
				</p>
				<p>
					You can reach me at <a href="mailto:hello@wgwoods.co.uk">hello@wgwoods.co.uk</a> or on
					<a href={LINKEDIN_URL}>LinkedIn</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Base>

<style>
	.about {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: var(--space-8);
		padding-top: var(--space-8);
	}
	.portrait {
		width: min(16rem, 60vw);
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 8px;
	}
	.prose {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}
	@media (min-width: 52rem) {
		.about {
			grid-template-columns: 10rem 1fr;
			gap: var(--space-10, 2.5rem);
			align-items: start;
		}
		.portrait {
			width: 100%;
			margin-top: var(--space-2);
		}
	}
</style>
